  "body": "The html spec only mentioned mutation events a handful of times, but now that they [have been removed from some browsers](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/305#issuecomment-2302407051) it feels safe to remove these mentions from the spec.\n\n- [X] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium\n   * [Gecko](https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/807)\n   * [WebKit](https://github.com/WebKit/standards-positions/issues/192)\n- [X] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/47727\n- [ ] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: https://issues.chromium.org/issues/40268638\n   * Gecko: …\n   * WebKit: …\n- [ ] [MDN issue](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) is filed: …\n- [X] The top of this comment includes a [clear commit message]\n\nCloses https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/305\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/common-dom-interfaces.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">/common-dom-interfaces.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/cf5565c...7906152/common-dom-interfaces.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">/dom.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/cf5565c...7906152/dom.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">/dynamic-markup-insertion.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/cf5565c...7906152/dynamic-markup-insertion.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/interactive-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">/interactive-elements.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/cf5565c...7906152/interactive-elements.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">/parsing.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/cf5565c...7906152/parsing.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">/xhtml.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/10573/cf5565c...7906152/xhtml.html\" title=\"Last updated on Aug 23, 2024, 4:22 PM UTC (7906152)\">diff</a> )",
